{"contents": [{"_id": "6a953c4db75b366545fe3930", "name": "李-恩菲尔德狙击枪", "desc": "采用10发容量的7.62毫米可拆卸弹匣，其独特的枪机结构支持高效的快速拉栓射击操作，射手可在扣动扳机后迅速完成退壳与重新上膛，射速远超常规栓动步枪，同时保留优异的单发精度，在中近距离交战中，对配备二级防具的目标具有较强的压制能力", "kindName": "狙击枪", "thumbImg": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0831/p1s.png", "mainImg": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0831/p1.jpeg", "data": null}, {"_id": "6a3e24e6b75b366545e11c7b", "name": "赤霄突击步枪", "desc": "特殊空投武器，使用5.8毫米口径步枪弹，空投获取即满配，附带专属三倍瞄具，武器射速高、子弹初速快，连续射击枪身稳定，是爆发与精准兼备的顶级突击步枪", "kindName": "突击步枪", "thumbImg": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0626/p1s.png", "mainImg": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0626/p1.jpeg", "data": null}, {"_id": "69dc743cb75b366545c07cef", "name": "97MG轻机枪", "desc": "使用5.56毫米口径子弹的班用轻机枪，采用无托式设计，结构紧凑，使用更长、更重的枪管，以提供持续射击时的可靠性，武器基础载弹量大，还可以加装快速弹匣配件，进一步加快换弹速度", "kindName": "轻机枪", "thumbImg": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0413/p1s.png", "mainImg": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0413/p1.jpeg", "data": null}, {"_id": "697719feb75b3665459eb2ab", "name": "AS50狙击枪", "desc": "使用.50口径子弹。武器枪口初速高，射程远，弹道平直；开火模式为半自动单发射击，配件可装备瞄准镜、弹匣、托腮板和侧面瞄准镜", "kindName": "狙击枪", "thumbImg": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0126/p1s.png", "mainImg": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0126/p1.jpeg"}, {"_id": "692591adb75b366545835605", "name": "MP7-G冲锋枪", "desc": "轻便的个人防卫武器，经过改造后可适配9mm口径子弹，理论射速高，易于精确瞄准。", "kindName": "冲锋枪", "thumbImg": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new1125/p1m.png", "mainImg": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new1125/p1.jpeg", "data": null}, {"_id": "68bee661b75b366545610aac", "name": "M338轻机枪", "desc": "空投武器，使用.338口径子弹，有效射程高，在远距离仍有可观伤害，且对载具装甲有一定的穿透能力，支持左右侧供弹与上膛，兼容双手操作；瞄具直接固定于机匣上，提升了安装的稳定性", "kindName": "轻机枪", "thumbImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0908/sec4-gun-pagin-img1.png", "mainImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0908/sec4-gun-img1.jpg", "data": null}, {"_id": "6853b39c022eae26f0018f1c", "name": "ARX突击步枪", "desc": "发射7.62mm子弹，具有火力强劲，后坐力低等优点；武器两侧均可抛壳，且有成对的操作开关，便于不同习惯的特种兵操作。", "kindName": "突击步枪", "thumbImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0619/sec4-gun-pagin-img8.png", "mainImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0619/sec4-gun-img8.jpg", "data": null}, {"_id": "6853b3bb022eae26f0018f29", "name": "M1加兰德", "desc": "著名经典武器，使用7.62mm子弹，可以快速连续单点射击，子弹打空后漏夹被顶起抛出，发出专属换弹声音：叮~；新增特殊投放渠道，仅能从战争遗迹箱获取。", "kindName": "射手步枪", "thumbImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0619/sec4-gun-pagin-img9.png", "mainImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0619/sec4-gun-img9.jpg", "data": null}, {"_id": "68425cb579dc8be70c0065a7", "name": "F57手枪", "desc": "空投武器（地铁暂不同步上线），与P90冲锋枪使用同型号5.7mm口径弹药。套筒使用钢塑复合结构，兼顾强度和轻量化需求，且经过改装，可全自动发射。倒地后可以使用（F57手枪专属能力）。", "kindName": "手枪", "thumbImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0327/sec4-gun-pagin-img7.png", "mainImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0327/sec4-gun-img7.jpg"}, {"_id": "68425cb579dc8be70c00658a", "name": "ACE32", "desc": "使用7.62mm子弹，稳定性强，威力较高，配件要求低，适合中近距离使用。", "kindName": "突击步枪", "thumbImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0110/sec4-gun-pagin-img1.png", "mainImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0110/sec4-gun-img1.jpg"}, {"_id": "68425cb579dc8be70c006589", "name": "JS9", "desc": "荣都限定，使用9mm子弹，高射速、高稳定，适合近距离房区巷战。", "kindName": "冲锋枪", "thumbImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0110/sec4-gun-pagin-img2.png", "mainImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/new0110/sec4-gun-img2.jpg"}, {"_id": "68425cb579dc8be70c0065b9", "name": "AKM", "desc": "使用7.62mm子弹，拥有单发和全自动两种模式，单发伤害高是它最大的优势，但后坐力很大，难以操控；推荐高手使用。", "kindName": "突击步枪", "thumbImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/sec4-gun-pagin-img1.png", "mainImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/sec4-gun-img1.jpg"}, {"_id": "68425cb579dc8be70c00658b", "name": "M416", "desc": "使用5.56mm子弹，拥有单发和全自动两种模式，可装配配件丰富，满配件后稳定性强，是一把非常全面的武器，适合各种距离下使用，唯一缺点是过于依赖配件。", "kindName": "突击步枪", "thumbImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/sec4-gun-pagin-img2.png", "mainImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/sec4-gun-img2.jpg"}, {"_id": "68425cb579dc8be70c006590", "name": "SCAR-L", "desc": "使用5.56mm子弹，拥有单发和全自动两种模式。后坐力低，容易操控，精准而稳定，综合性能优异，缺点是射速不如其他使用5.56mm子弹的步枪。", "kindName": "突击步枪", "thumbImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/sec4-gun-pagin-img3.png", "mainImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/sec4-gun-img3.jpg"}, {"_id": "68425cb579dc8be70c0065c4", "name": "Kar98K", "desc": "使用7.62mm子弹，性能优异的单发栓动狙击枪。单发伤害高，能一击摧毁二级头，缺点是仅适合远距离使用，十分依赖高倍镜，对枪法依赖很高，尽量命中头部才能发挥威力。", "kindName": "狙击步枪", "thumbImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/sec4-gun-pagin-img4.png", "mainImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/sec4-gun-img4.jpg"}, {"_id": "68425cb579dc8be70c0065ba", "name": "S686", "desc": "双管猎枪，在地图中十分常见。虽然仅有2发弹容量，但是2发子弹设计间隔非常短，爆发高，近距离霰弹威力巨大，所以有“S686天下无敌”的美誉，但容错率低，2发没淘汰对方就尴尬了，几乎只能近距离使用。", "kindName": "霰弹枪", "thumbImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/sec4-gun-pagin-img5.png", "mainImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/sec4-gun-img5.jpg"}, {"_id": "68425cb579dc8be70c0065a2", "name": "沙漠之鹰", "desc": "使用.45子弹，经典的大威力狩猎手枪，你所能找到的最强方位手枪。", "kindName": "手枪", "thumbImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/sec4-gun-pagin-img6.png", "mainImg": "//game.gtimg.cn/images/gp/web202411/sec4-gun-img6.jpg"}], "relationData": {}, "contentType": {"_id": "684259ce333f5ab1a4921ee0", "app": "684259a4333f5ab1a4921ece", "name": "枪械数据", "columns": [{"header": "武器名称", "name": "name", "sortable": false, "isIndex": true, "_id": "68425cae333f5ab1a4922021"}, {"header": "武器描述", "name": "desc", "sortable": false, "isIndex": false, "_id": "68425cae333f5ab1a4922022"}, {"header": "武器类型", "name": "kindName", "sortable": false, "isIndex": false, "_id": "68425cae333f5ab1a4922023"}, {"header": "缩略图URL", "name": "thumbImg", "sortable": false, "isIndex": false, "_id": "68425cae333f5ab1a4922024"}, {"header": "主图URL", "name": "mainImg", "sortable": false, "isIndex": false, "_id": "68425cae333f5ab1a4922025"}], "appDetails": [{"_id": "684259a4333f5ab1a4921ece", "project": "684258cc333f5ab1a4921ebc", "key": "os", "name": "游戏官网", "projectDetails": [{"_id": "684258cc333f5ab1a4921ebc", "key": "gp", "name": "和平精英"}]}]}}